POST https://viajealser.com/api/v1/SER/users/689a64f21b42abd1f487ddc4/follow
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
}

### 21. SER: Unfollow usuario real en producción
DELETE https://viajealser.com/api/v1/SER/users/689a64f21b42abd1f487ddc4/follow
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
}

### 22. SER: Obtener seguidores por ID de usuario (Frontend compatibility)
GET {{baseUrl}}/SER/users/{{targetUserId}}/followers
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 23. SER: Obtener siguiendo por ID de usuario (Frontend compatibility)
GET {{baseUrl}}/SER/users/{{targetUserId}}/following
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 24. SER: Obtener estadísticas de follow por ID de usuario (Frontend compatibility)
GET {{baseUrl}}/SER/users/{{targetUserId}}/follow-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 25. SER: Test con paginación - Followers
GET {{baseUrl}}/SER/users/{{targetUserId}}/followers?limit=10&cursor=2024-01-15T10:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 26. SER: Test con paginación - Following
GET {{baseUrl}}/SER/users/{{targetUserId}}/following?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}